Package: orbital-background
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: @MAINTAINER@
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Section: graphics
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/Contr0versy/orbital-background
Description: retro wireframe solar system live wallpaper for Wayland
 Polyhedral planets, a ringed world, moons and a comet follow elliptical
 Keplerian orbits around a central star, drawn as depth-faded wireframes
 over a parallax starfield.
 .
 A single static binary with no library dependencies. Runs as a
 power-aware live wallpaper on Wayland compositors with wlr-layer-shell
 (niri, sway, Hyprland, river).
